DESCRIPTION:21st Annual Holiday Show - 2026 at Jessica Hagen Fine Art + De
 sign Exhibition Dates: November 21- December 31\, 2026 Opening Reception: 
 November 21\, 2026\, 5:00- 7:00 PM Location: 9A Bridge Street\, Newport\, 
 RI 02840 Contact: Jessica Hagen at jessica@jessicahagen.com or 401-835-768
 2 Jessica Hagen Fine Art + Design is pleased to announce the opening of th
 e gallery’s 2026 Holiday Show with an Opening Reception on Saturday Nove
 mber 21\, 2026 from 5:00- 7:00 PM. The show features new work by over thre
 e dozen gallery artists and includes paintings\, sculpture\, photography\,
  ceramics\, jewelry\, art books\, textiles\, and Hunt Slonem Hop Up Shop m
 erchandise. The gallery offers gift certificates and gift wrapping. Galler
 y owner Jessica Hagen states\, “The holiday show is the something for ev
 eryone show of the year. From paintings of all sizes and subject matter\, 
 to artisan-made jewelry\, books\, ceramics\, sculpture\, glass and more\, 
 it’s wonderful to celebrate the season with art and objects made with cr
 eativity\, skill and dedication. Human beings are irreplaceably amazing!
 ” The show will be on display through December 31\, 2026. Jessica Hagen 
 Fine Art + Design was founded in 2005 and features contemporary art includ
 ing painting\, sculpture\, photography\, ceramics\, textiles\, and jewelry
 . Located in the historic Point section of Newport\, the gallery’s hours
  are Wednesday through Saturday 11:00- 5:00 and Sunday 12:00-5:00. Monday 
 and Tuesday\, the gallery is open by appointment. Image attached: Willy He
 eks Day (2026) oil/acrylic/pencil/canvas mounted panel 23.25” x 23.75”
 \n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/21st-annual-holiday-sho
 w/112639/
LOCATION:9A Bridge Street\, Newport\, RI 02840 Contact: Jessica Hagen at j
 essica@jessicahagen.com or 401-835-7682 Jessica Hagen Fine Art + Design is
  pleased to announce the opening of the gallery’s 2026 Holiday Show with
  an Opening Reception on Saturday November 21\, 2026 from 5:00- 7:00 PM. T
 he show features new work by over three dozen gallery artists and includes
  paintings\, sculpture\, photography\, ceramics\, jewelry\, art books\, te
 xtiles\, and Hunt Slonem Hop Up Shop merchandise. The gallery offers gift 
 certificates and gift wrapping. Gallery owner Jessica Hagen states\, “Th
 e holiday show is the something for everyone show of the year. From painti
 ngs of all sizes and subject matter\, to artisan-made jewelry\, books\, ce
 ramics\, sculpture\, glass and more\, it’s wonderful to celebrate the se
 ason with art and objects made with creativity\, skill and dedication. Hum
 an beings are irreplaceably amazing!” The show will be on display throug
 h December 31\, 2026. Jessica Hagen Fine Art + Design was founded in 2005 
 and features contemporary art including painting\, sculpture\, photography
 \, ceramics\, textiles\, and jewelry. Located in the historic Point sectio
 n of Newport\, the gallery’s hours are Wednesday through Saturday 11:00-
  5:00 and Sunday 12:00-5:00. Monday and Tuesday\, the gallery is open by a
 ppointment. Image attached: Willy Heeks Day (2026) oil/acrylic/pencil/canv
 as mounted panel 23.25” x 23.75” Show More View Website | Email 1 / 1 
 Additional Information\, 9A Bridge Street\, Newport\, RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/21st-annual-holiday-show/112639
 /
