 al\, Ivessa the Friesian horse. Every tour brings you up close and persona
 l with the animals and now\, you get to choose your type of tour\, includi
 ng: - Executive Tour - Tours with Mrs. Claus (Saturday only) - Animalmaxxi
 ng - Vineyard Tours - Garden &amp\; Greenhouse Tours - Full Tours - Drivin
 g Tours Whether you are a first-time guest or a repeat visitor\, West Plac
 e has a tour for everybody. Explore all of the options at westplace.org/vi
 sitors-weekends. Plus\, the Gift Shop will be open all weekend long with o
 ur first-ever Holiday Sale\, featuring deep discounts of 10% to 50% off se
 lected items! Don't complete your holiday shopping without stopping by Wes
 t Place for one-of-a-kind gifts for every animal lover on your list. Skip 
 the Black Friday crowds and support your local farm animal sanctuary on Sm
 all Business Saturday! West Place Animal Sanctuary is a 501(c)(3) nonprofi
 t serving underrepresented and overlooked animal populations since 2007. A
 ll proceeds benefit the farm animals and wildlife in our care.\n\nSource: 
