 e FREE &#8211\; we ask that you please check in at the rink’s ticket win
 dow to sign a waiver. 🪩 Partygoers can bring their own ice skates\, or 
 rentals and lockers are also available at the venue for a fee. Visit the P
 rovidence Rink webpage for venue FAQ &amp\; ice-skate rental info. This sp
 ecial event is presented as part of PVD Holiday Festival\, a celebration o
 f light\, culture and community taking place December 3-6 in Downtown Prov
 idence. For the full festival schedule visit https://www.pvdholidayfest.or
 g Made possible with support from Providence Tourism Council\, Go Providen
 ce and the City of Providence Dept. of Art\, Culture\, Tourism.\n\nSource:
